(text "AI-4 CARD, card type 0x0011. 4 configurable analog inputs (0-5/0-10 V, 4-20 mA\nshunt, resistive sender via current source).\nSelf-contained: own ADS1115 (0x48 on the slot I2C bus), own VMID buffer, own\nVBAT_AI pre-regulator and LM4040 current-source reference, own MCP23S17.\nMCP23S17: GPA0-3 CS_DIS1-4 (47k pull-up: source OFF at reset), GPA4-7 SH_EN1-4\n(47k pull-down: shunt open at reset); GPB0-3 slot ID straps, GPB4-7 unused\n(NC, GPPU on). Shunts only close while OUT_EN_N is low (backplane: PWR_EN AND\nWD_OK AND NRST AND SLOT_RST_N AND slot ARM).\nSlot logic behind IOFF buffers (74LVC125A in, 1G125 MISO, 1G07 INT_N);\nOUT_EN_N pull-up on +3V3_ID (always on).\nBaseline names: IN1..IN4 = AI3..AI6. Net changes: net_changes.csv." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 104.14 191.77 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e2a79934-03f3-457f-baa6-c69e0aeb7381"))
